Ideas, no code
- Keka by aONe (Jorge Garcia), https://www.keka.io and
  https://github.com/aonez/Keka. The repository states no licence. pakket
  copies none of its code or artwork; it follows Keka's feature set as
  documented on keka.io and in the Keka wiki: the create and extract format
  lists, solid 7z, exclude Mac resource forks, split volumes, archive items
  separately, delete after compression, encrypted 7z file names, optional
  AES-256 zip, and the export-password and MD5 sidecar files. "Keka" is
  used here only to describe what pakket is similar to.
